                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August 12,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Rockhill reports formal agreement upon draft of final protocol.</p>
                <p>Rice, foreign cereals and flour, gold and silver bullion and coin are included in
                    the free list.)</p>
